## 4. Restricted commercial exploitation

Without prior written permission from the Copyright Holder, you may not:

a. Sell, sublicense, or otherwise commercially distribute YAP or a Derivative Work as a standalone or competing software product.

b. Offer or operate a Hosted Service that provides third parties with access to the core functionality of YAP or a Derivative Work as an independently offered software service.

