These restrictions do not prohibit ordinary commercial use of YAP within a business, permitted professional services, or the sale of independent Plugins in accordance with Section 5.

The restrictions apply only to rights in materials that the Copyright Holder is entitled to license. Third-party components remain subject to their respective licenses.

## 5. Community Plugins and Enterprise Features

Developers may create, distribute, license, and commercially sell independent Plugins for YAP.

Plugins must not implement or provide functionality designated as reserved Enterprise functionality by the Copyright Holder and documented on the official YAP website at https://yet-another-pim.eu.

The designation of Enterprise Features must identify the relevant functionality with reasonable specificity.

This restriction applies to the implementation or provision of designated Enterprise functionality, regardless of whether the Plugin is free or paid.

Ordinary integrations, customizations, and extensions are not prohibited solely because they are commercially valuable or distributed for a fee.

Exceptions require prior written permission from the Copyright Holder.

